  "about": "Social Corner (Per Se Social Corner, Per Se Hospitality Group) is a Michelin-recommended restaurant in Vancouver with two locations, Yaletown and Coal Harbour, sharing one menu. It brings the flavours of Italy and Spain together: tapas, fresh pasta, 800-degree wood-fired pizza, paellas, steaks, a caviar programme (bumps from $15) and a well-known burger, with a cocktail-led bar. The room is lively, social and warm, polished yet approachable: 'luxury with approachability'. Staff are in Canada: write in Canadian English, and give prices in Canadian dollars exactly as the list prints them (glasses are 5oz, some also 8oz).",
